From 40f3ae98e5080572d382b86f5d06a907ee915f7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: baverrr <342259467+baverrr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:45:34 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Bundle the Hey Raven model; add "stop" for reminders

- Bundle the openWakeWord melspectrogram, embedding and hey_raven models
  in assets/openWakeWord, so the wake word works without a download.
- Raise the wake threshold to 0.98, chosen for this model: about half of
  the noisy test clips caught with about 0.28 false wakes per hour.
- Accept "stop", "stop reminding me", "enough" and similar to end a
  ringing alert; reminders show a Stop button and a "Hey Raven, stop"
  hint instead of "Turn off".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
